  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to partner governments to develop and deliver effective policies to mitigate the economic impacts of Covid-19</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Support to partner governments to develop and deliver effective policies to mitigate the economic impacts of Covid-19 is a component of Accelerated Covid 19 Economic Support (ACES) reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xA3;6,388,101. This project benefits Africa, regional. It works in the following sector(s): Public sector policy and administrative management.</narrative>
  </description>
